  "prefLabel": "Ph 601.05 Changes in Supporting Information",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-04-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 601.05 Changes in Supporting Information. The applicant shall notify the board, immediately, of any changes of information from that which was submitted on the original application pursuant to Ph 601.03. Failure to report changes shall result in the imposition of a $25 administrative fine. No license shall be issued until all fees and fines are paid in full.\n\nSource. #8572, eff 2-23-06; ss by #9139-B, eff 4-25-08, EXPIRED: 4-25-16\n\nNew. #12335, eff 7-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
